**NOT CONVERGED.** The five original blockers’ exact probes now pass, but the remediation introduced one new blocking store-clause scanning defect. One non-blocking documentation drift also remains.

All probes are under `/tmp/sol-s4-r2/`. The repository remains unchanged except for the pre-existing untracked stdout log:

